Z||000003||Voytek||08-24-2001||01:46 PM||||I would suggest timing - take it to a shop if you can't do it yourself.  Mine used to backfire and hard start after a rebuilt.  Turned out the shop has set the distributor about 5 degrees out.<BR>Next time around, when I changed the pickup coil, had the timing set for $20 CDN.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
